ank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:0d967e3f-a266-4907-952c-f2886c741b54\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Muzz\" title=\"Muzz\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Muzz.png/25px-Portrait_Muzz.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Muzz.png/38px-Portrait_Muzz.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Muzz.png/50px-Portrait_Muzz.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Muzz\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Muzz.png/25px-Portrait_Muzz.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Portrait_Muzz.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Muzz\" title=\"Muzz\">Muzz</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Under_Temple_Cave_Area\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Under Temple Cave Area\">Under Temple Cave Area</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Aspirant Dolor is... talented, if a touch careless. <a href=\"/wiki/Stillmaker\" title=\"Stillmaker\">The dagger</a> he discarded lurks within these caves somewhere, though I know not where. I can smell it. The fear-musk from his kills stands in the air after the act because he lets them <i>marinate</i> first. They stand-lie-sit stock still as the poison fills their limbs with lead, knowing only two perfect facts:\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>They are going to die.\n</p><p>There is nothing they can do about it.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202109\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.053 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.056 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1847/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27439/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7474/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 27/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 930654/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   45.027      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   45.027      1 -total\n 60.10%   27.059      8 Template:Icon_text\n 53.82%   24.235     19 Template:Trim\n 34.18%   15.389      1 Template:PageSeo\n 34.02%   15.320      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 26.80%   12.067      2 Template:CharLink\n 25.97%   11.692      3 Template:Icon_link\n 21.36%    9.616      2 Template:Uid\n 20.65%    9.297      8 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12850-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202109 and revision id 364454. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}